<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-25T12:40:45.214Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 12:40:45 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli forces stepped up air operations over Syria and warned the Druze against renewed attacks, while Israeli fire killed a Syrian man and a security officer was martyred in an armed attack in the Daraa countryside. Protesters in Syria demonstrated against repeated Israeli incursions, blocking the Damascus-Suwayda road and demanding detainee releases. Security incidents were reported in Hama and Aleppo, and a Syrian security operation against a Daesh cell resulted in casualties. The Syrian Investment Authority and a Saudi ambassador discussed a joint food-security megaproject. 2732 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNRzFxMmE4dWx3blk3Yy1MSGJTOXI4NC1URUM3OFBTdzdKUGRWWWRLLXl2bXJfNmoxLXJ6dmN3RFdmU0pRanZsN3dMXzZWaDRpbFhhdm1wanFDQ2FkdUxGcFoyaW41MjkwMER1RDVfRF9MLTgxcTlCMl9tTGgzOFNWV2NublFLUkM2VjBDU3A5Wm9SdVZfeEFyQlRjc09yc0pocTF1emZPMlJ2dVUzRkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxNSC1nQXdzUDZqdGNJdUZhVm5yVlhmRzVGeFlNTk5Ubkc3VmJCV3FjaHdsSEVnRDIta2oxR3VpNWo2LURaYTF1dFBhOGdFbmZEYktoNmZ6cWxLaDM3ZER3M0xkazExTC1uMFRFc1lSUmk5bWNYYmNoQ3kzTXY3bThBaWNpbG9WMFlfVll3eGdtMTdNLUtSUnhINFFkOV9qdkV4UWZmTw?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFByX3hUSmJucGdmRFU0SlB0QVMxRElTeVotWVJKTGNUcEMwbHZHMzZobklOTTdBVGtiT2s1Z1BCOUtRRDJpbEFEMg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE1nbElWUDJJc0xxNWlvQ2k1eUhBY2ZlWFNGZTh2QzgwWS1QU01BMFB6MUR2ckVHRVhBbDhwQkJHQnpGeDRTYkNjNGhFbW1iV1BWQlJ5RG5rY1c0OERx?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTFBCblZ2MkV3NDdVMUlhVVlyRnYzRnFIN2tDUWdtTW80UHJIRnA0